      <title>Crypto Wallet Maker Ledger Investigates Reports of User Funds Stolen</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-09/crypto-hardware-maker-ledger-says-wallets-drained-in-latest-attack</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">9862f88d490363181b94ede6</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 14:46:21 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Crypto hardware maker Ledger SAS said it’s investigating reports that a number of users had seen a “loss of funds” from their wallets, knocking the industry further as attacks continue to pepper a technology once considered impervious to digital theft.</description>
